<title>USA: Transco Research sees FY 1998 EPS $0.75.</title>
<headline>Transco Research sees FY 1998 EPS $0.75.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transco Research Corp said Wednesday it expects to record a fiscal 1998 profit of $0.75 per share on revenues of about $12 million.</p>
<p>The company said it based the projection on shipments of orders for its prepaid phone card vending equipment and its prepaid cellular phone products.</p>
<p>The company's fiscal year ends June 30.</p>
